(F5 T2 V6: element_dof_initial_specific_number / _value (manual
 Professional 6.423 / 6.424) on the bar of the Professional test
 other/phase1.dat (lumped inertia 1 per node, left node prescribed 1).
 Initial past temperature 0.1 + 0.8 x, evaluated at the nodes: right node
 past 0.9, so (1-T) = (T-0.9) gives node_dof 2 = 0.95
 (Professional 02-08-2026 probe f5/v6 d, same input).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
condif_temperature
end_initia
inertia_apply -yes
node 1  0
node 2  1
element 1  -bar2 1 2
element_dof_initial_specific_number 1 -temp
element_dof_initial_specific_value 1 0.1 0.8
bounda_dof   0  1 -temp
bounda_time  0  1.
group_type 0  -condif
group_condif_density 0  1.0
group_condif_capacity 0  2.
group_condif_conductivity 0  1.
control_timestep   0  1. 1.0
control_print      0  -node_dof
end_data
